@motion
subtitle: The historical choice. Buck's cabinet resigns and stays on as caretaker. · dev: spd_relation −2, kf_left_dissent −2, d_saxony_org +2
on-arrival: spd_relation -= 2; kf_left_dissent -= 2; d_saxony_org += 2
go-to: root

The motion passes with our votes and those of every bourgeois party. Buck's ministry resigns and carries on as caretaker. The SPD's right says the Communists have voted with reaction; the SPD's left in Leipzig and Chemnitz says that a Social Democratic government should have met the conditions. The next Minister-President will need our votes, and he will know the price.

